{"version":1,"content":"<p>向有「樂壇判官」之稱的65歲資深音樂人周啟生，近年屢因言論出位掀起風波。</p><p>繼早前連環點評楊千嬅、陳蕾及伍仲衡等音樂人後，他日前再度在社交平台開火，上載許志安於《西九爵士音樂節》的演出片段，直斥對方「走音部分都費事講，完全冇爵士嘅任何元素。</p><p>」面</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T10:23:47.214412+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T10:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T10:17:12.134434+00:00","content_hash":"843508b058164c04ad98bd25ba3b00fcbbe4b225121bc205b0f7be955c7ddec8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}